...can't.

00:16:27.460 --> 00:16:28.420
Huh?

00:16:28.420 --> 00:16:30.050
I can't do it!

00:16:30.050 --> 00:16:32.130
Not to this... this man's...

00:16:32.510 --> 00:16:34.180
This man's what?

00:16:34.390 --> 00:16:35.760
You know what!

00:16:35.760 --> 00:16:39.550
At least, you should know the name of
São Tomé and Príncipe's minister of health...

00:16:40.600 --> 00:16:43.100
You all should know, right?!

00:16:50.900 --> 00:16:51.730
Are you all right?

00:16:53.110 --> 00:16:54.270
Haruto...

00:16:54.700 --> 00:16:57.280
How did you escape?

00:16:57.280 --> 00:17:01.410
As long as you, the witch, isn't there,
there's stuff that I can do.

00:17:15.970 --> 00:17:18.010
Go!

00:17:24.100 --> 00:17:26.190
I can't get this birdlime off!

00:17:26.650 --> 00:17:28.750
I can't take anymore...

00:17:29.940 --> 00:17:31.690
Y-You did that?

00:17:32.150 --> 00:17:34.190
This is a dream.

00:17:34.190 --> 00:17:35.200
Anything goes.

00:17:37.610 --> 00:17:39.280
I feel like a fool.

00:17:39.280 --> 00:17:40.450
What do you mean?

00:17:40.450 --> 00:17:41.910
I mean, I am a fool, right?

00:17:41.910 --> 00:17:46.120
I came to this world,
and everything went my way,

00:17:46.120 --> 00:17:50.210
and I thought I'd pay back everyone
who'd hurt me in the past...

00:17:50.790 --> 00:17:53.380
But in the end, I was the one
who lost and ran away.

00:17:53.880 --> 00:17:57.470
I can't believe I ended up
a loser even inside a dream...

00:17:58.220 --> 00:18:01.850
But the you in the real world
isn't a loser at all, right?

00:18:02.260 --> 00:18:04.270
You've been a perfect idol this whole time--

00:18:04.270 --> 00:18:05.100
Stop it!

00:18:05.890 --> 00:18:07.850
I'm not a perfect idol.

00:18:07.850 --> 00:18:15.990
"Good Dreams"

00:18:08.520 --> 00:18:11.020
Hey, Misaki, it's fine, isn't it?

00:18:11.020 --> 00:18:14.860
N-No, I didn't come here for that...

00:18:16.900 --> 00:18:18.390
Thanks for the scoop!

00:18:21.700 --> 00:18:27.540
We can't be having this. An idol being
sold as "pure" can't have a scandal.

00:18:27.540 --> 00:18:28.750
--What am I going to say to the sponsors--

00:18:28.750 --> 00:18:30.710
--I humbly apologize!
--What am I going to say to the sponsors--

00:18:30.710 --> 00:18:33.300
Regarding this incident, our agency will--

00:18:33.300 --> 00:18:36.130
What's the use of the manager apologizing?

00:18:36.130 --> 00:18:39.510
It'll be more effective if, you know...

00:18:39.510 --> 00:18:41.010
What do you mean?

00:18:41.010 --> 00:18:49.010
You don't get it? You know, Misaki's got
a lot of fans in the business, too...

00:18:49.440 --> 00:18:51.270
I'm not a perfect idol...

00:18:51.770 --> 00:18:55.300
I go to the bathroom, and I want
to try falling in love with a boy.

00:18:55.780 --> 00:18:59.450
But for the sake of the fans
and the other members,

00:18:59.450 --> 00:19:02.580
I kept holding myself back,
kept playing the idol.

00:19:03.080 --> 00:19:04.400
Even so...

00:19:05.040 --> 00:19:07.450
I think you've got the wrong idea.

00:19:07.450 --> 00:19:08.040
Huh?

00:19:08.540 --> 00:19:11.810
You were holding back for the sake of others?

00:19:12.250 --> 00:19:13.170
That's not true, is it?

00:19:13.920 --> 00:19:15.530
Wasn't it for the sake of your own dream?

00:19:16.880 --> 00:19:20.010
People can become strong
because they have a dream.

00:19:20.010 --> 00:19:23.970
Because you felt strongly that
you wanted to become something,

00:19:23.970 --> 00:19:26.190
you were able to act wholeheartedly, right?

00:19:28.270 --> 00:19:29.730
Those eyes of yours...

00:19:29.730 --> 00:19:30.810
My eyes?

00:19:30.810 --> 00:19:34.190
More precisely, your eyes
when you were Nana...

00:19:34.770 --> 00:19:39.150
Those eyes of yours woke up something
inside me that had been sleeping.

00:19:39.780 --> 00:19:44.270
I want to make everyone in the world
happy with my singing and dancing.

00:19:45.280 --> 00:19:48.410
But, but you know, it's actually different.

00:19:49.370 --> 00:19:51.380
It's just that I don't want to get hurt.

00:19:52.080 --> 00:19:55.420
I guess I'll try doing my best again.

00:19:55.710 --> 00:19:56.710
Misaki...

00:19:57.420 --> 00:20:01.090
Thank you, Nana. I mean, Haruto.

00:20:01.090 --> 00:20:02.680
I'm glad I met you.

00:20:04.850 --> 00:20:08.640
If I'm the witch of this world,
then who are you?

00:20:08.640 --> 00:20:10.180
Could you be the prince?

00:20:11.560 --> 00:20:12.440
Maybe.

00:20:13.020 --> 00:20:16.550
Now, the spell's about 
to be broken, Princess.

00:20:21.200 --> 00:20:24.030
I don't know anything about men...

00:20:26.450 --> 00:20:29.730
...but your "little Haruto"
is going to catch a cold.

00:20:36.380 --> 00:20:42.800
<i>...women fear nothing!</i>
<i>Let’s smash through the status quo</i>

00:20:42.800 --> 00:20:49.560
S-H-A-R-K Shark Ladies!
1, 2, 3, 4, one more bite!

00:20:49.560 --> 00:20:53.140
Really I just don’t want to get hurt

00:20:53.140 --> 00:21:03.110
I can’t stop, gotta have you
all to myself, and fast

00:21:09.200 --> 00:21:11.550
I have an announcement to make today.

00:21:16.420 --> 00:21:22.460
I, Misaki from Shark Lady,
will no longer be an idol after today!

00:21:22.670 --> 00:21:23.530
What?!

00:21:23.880 --> 00:21:25.880
So the rumors were true!

00:21:25.880 --> 00:21:27.260
You traitor!

00:21:27.260 --> 00:21:29.640
I have learned of love!

00:21:29.640 --> 00:21:33.090
From now on, as a solo 
singer... as a woman...

00:21:33.930 --> 00:21:35.760
I will chase my dream!

00:21:39.980 --> 00:21:44.150
Show us how you look chasing
your dream with all your might!

00:21:49.420 --> 00:21:51.370
Okay, Misaki?

00:21:55.960 --> 00:22:04.090
<i>Touching my broken wing, I appreciate</i>
<i>the sky’s freedom, its good and bad</i>

00:22:04.090 --> 00:22:09.930
<i>And I spread my wings once more</i>

00:22:09.930 --> 00:22:17.060
<i>Battered by the wind,</i>
<i>devastated by the rain</i>

00:22:17.060 --> 00:22:23.030
<i>Despite my fear of the night,</i>
<i>I’ll fix my eyes on the horizon again</i>

00:22:24.320 --> 00:22:31.120
<i>Because it’s the only way to get my wish</i>

00:22:31.120 --> 00:22:38.170
<i>Even imperfect, I’ll fly, however clumsily</i>

00:22:38.170 --> 00:22:45.090
<i>Each time I make it through</i>
<i>the dark into dawn</i>

00:22:45.090 --> 00:22:50.550
<i>I know I’ll get a little stronger</i>

00:22:51.890 --> 00:22:58.810
<i>I’ll seize the headwind, bend it and fly</i>
<i>to the uninhabited reaches of the sky</i>

00:22:58.810 --> 00:23:05.150
<i>The reason I can fly solo</i>
<i>is because I have you</i>

00:23:05.150 --> 00:23:12.910
<i>My glittering memories,</i>
<i>and even my lingering wounds,</i>

00:23:12.910 --> 00:23:19.710
<i>Give me the strength to take flight now</i>

00:23:27.840 --> 00:23:29.340
Let's go on an adventure

00:23:29.510 --> 00:23:31.140
inside someone's dream.

00:23:31.840 --> 00:23:34.490
I'm sure that will be pleasant.

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:36.500
Pleasant, baa!

00:23:35.810 --> 00:23:41.440
"Dream Dimension α"

00:23:36.860 --> 00:23:40.240
Next time's dream is "Dream Dimension α."
